    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86718" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαρπάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snatch away before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἰκτῖνος τὰ ὄψα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					54
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δόξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					13.5.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἡγεμονίαν τινί</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				20.8.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀλλήλων τὰ λεγόμενα</span>
			<i>snap at</i> a conclusion, <i>anticipate hastily,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				454c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ζητούμενον π. ὡς ὁμολογούμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.157
				</span></i>
			.</div>
